  <item>
    <title>《哪吒2》是史诗还是爆米花？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b566a705a90dfd0d70ca9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b566a705a90dfd0d70ca9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2025 05:10:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一位父亲眼中的《哪吒2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 一言为定，大搞特搞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 喜闻乐见的打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 120+亿票房，是否有情绪泡沫？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 在李靖身上看到了自己的心境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 隐射老美是过度解读吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 尊重性别的最好方式是“忘记性别”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> &nbsp;不想当大V，只想当大哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>台词分享：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“你今后的路还很长，别在意别人的看法。你是谁只有你自己说了才算，永远不要放弃。”——李靖</span></p><span></span><p><span>“哪怕全世界都与你为敌，为父也会站在你身前。”——李靖</span></p><span></span><p><span>“放屁，别人的看法都是狗屁，你是谁只有你自己说了才算，这是爹教我的道理。若命运不公，就和它斗到底。”——哪吒</span></p><span></span><p><span>“做万丈火焰，做逆鳞一片，做名为自己的瞬间。”——哪吒</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67b3d6559ca521ef64502022/lpvjlWEWCQzS2zirxdLq6Jm91eU-.m4a" length="15912451" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:16:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLrN8o-X8jxdWa5LGBsryJwHgDn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
